0","term":"뒤지다","zh":"翻，翻找","audio":"/audio/8a3b2270d7b0c5505f3e.mp3","entryId":"14998","definition":"为了找某物而仔细找。","pronunciation":["뒤지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/02aef3d31b2236d3e6fa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.138,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14998","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9647,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没看到。你翻翻包和衣服口袋看看。","你看见我的钱包了吗？","敏俊比我们低一届，不过听说年龄一样。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看见我的钱包了吗？","敏俊比我们低一届，不过听说年龄一样。","没看到。你翻翻包和衣服口袋看看。"],"answer":2}]}
